#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:4 blog/templates/blog/home.html:53
msgid "关于"
msgstr "About"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:16
msgid "每一段经历，都是代码的一部分。"
msgstr "Every experience is part of the code."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:18
msgid "从最初的好奇到如今的专注，这是一段关于成长、坚持与热爱的旅程。"
msgstr ""
"From initial curiosity to dedicated focus - a journey of growth, "
"persistence, and passion."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:30
msgid "自我评价"
msgstr "Self Assessment"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:38
msgid ""
"「真正的技术价值不在于掌握多少工具，而在于能否用合适的技术解决实际问题。」"
msgstr ""
"「The true value of technology lies not in how many tools you master, but in "
"whether you can solve real problems with the right technology.」"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:42
msgid ""
"从 PLC 底层控制到 AI 图像识别，再到全栈 Web 和 Chrome 扩展开发，我具备跨越多"
"层技术栈的实践能力。在机械设备制造商的核心研发部门，我负责产品搭载软件的全栈"
"开发，同时主导新技术（YOLO·ROS）的导入与推广——从技术选型、可行性验证到落地部"
"署，全程推动产品智能化升级。"
msgstr ""
"From PLC-level control to AI image recognition to full-stack web and Chrome "
"extension development, I have practical experience spanning multiple "
"technology layers. In the core R&D department, I am responsible for full-"
"stack development of onboard software while leading the introduction of new "
"technologies (YOLO·ROS) — from technology selection to deployment."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:45
#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:45
msgid ""
"我善于识别业务流程中的痛点并运用技术手段解决。曾开发 Python 自动化工具将硬件 "
"ID 设定作业时间从 20 分钟缩短至 1 分钟（缩减 95%%），大幅提升团队工作效率。这"
"个经历让我深刻理解：好的工具不在于技术复杂度，而在于能否精准命中业务痛点。"
msgstr ""
"I excel at identifying process pain points and solving them with technical "
"solutions. I developed a Python automation tool that reduced hardware ID "
"setup time from 20 minutes to 1 minute (95% reduction). This experience "
"taught me that good tools aren't about technical complexity but about "
"precisely hitting business pain points."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:48
msgid ""
"在业余时间，我通过个人项目持续拓宽技术边界——从计算机视觉流水线到 RAG 智能问答"
"系统，再到已上架 Chrome Web Store 的浏览器扩展。这些项目既是学习驱动，也是对"
"「技术如何改善日常生活」的持续探索。"
msgstr ""
"In my spare time, I continuously expand my technical boundaries through "
"personal projects — from computer vision pipelines to RAG QA systems to "
"Chrome extensions published on the Chrome Web Store. These projects are both "
"learning-driven and a continuous exploration of how technology can improve "
"daily life."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:61
msgid "不止代码"
msgstr "Beyond Code"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:64
msgid "兴趣与关注"
msgstr "Interests & Focus"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:68
msgid ""
"技术之外，持续关注 AI 前沿论文、开源社区与产品设计。相信好的工程师不仅要能写"
"代码，更要理解技术与人之间的关系。"
msgstr ""
"Beyond technology, I follow AI papers, open source communities, and product "
"design. I believe a good engineer should not just write code, but also "
"understand the relationship between technology and people."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:73
msgid "阅读技术论文"
msgstr "Reading Research Papers"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:74
msgid ""
"常浏览 ArXiv 上的 AI 论文，关注计算机视觉与 NLP 前沿进展。虽然很多论文读起来"
"吃力，但每理解一个新 idea 都让人兴奋。"
msgstr ""
"I frequently browse AI papers on ArXiv, following the latest advances in CV "
"and NLP. Though many papers are challenging, understanding each new idea is "
"exciting."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:77
msgid "开源社区"
msgstr "Open Source Community"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:78
msgid ""
"关注 GitHub 优秀开源项目，学习代码风格与架构设计。将自己的项目也开源在 "
"GitHub 上，希望为社区贡献价值。"
msgstr ""
"I follow great open-source projects on GitHub, learning from excellent code "
"styles and architectures. I also open-source my own projects, hoping to "
"contribute value to the community."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:81
msgid "写作与表达"
msgstr "Writing & Expression"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:82
msgid ""
"清晰的写作是清晰思考的外在表现。无论是技术笔记还是个人感悟，都力求用简洁、准"
"确的语言传达复杂的思想。"
msgstr ""
"I believe clear writing reflects clear thinking. Whether technical notes or "
"personal insights, I strive to express complex ideas in concise, precise "
"language."

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:85
msgid "跨领域学习"
msgstr "Cross-Disciplinary Learning"

#: blog/templates/blog/about.html:86
msgid ""
"关注产品设计、认知科学和个人效率提升方法。不同领域的知识交叉往往能带来意想不"
"到的启发。"
msgstr ""
"I follow product design, cognitive science, and personal productivity "
"methods. Cross-pollination between different fields often brings unexpected "
"insights."

