#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Deep-dived into Django framework, from backend API design to frontend "
#~ "template rendering, mastering the full web development workflow. Built a "
#~ "personal blog system to transform learning into structured knowledge "
#~ "output."

#~ msgid "Python 与数据科学入门"
#~ msgstr "Python & Data Science"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "从 Python 基础语法开始，逐步深入到 NumPy、Pandas、Matplotlib 等数据科学生"
#~ "态工具。建立扎实的编程基础，为后续的 AI 学习奠定了坚实的技术根基。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Started with Python basics, then progressed to NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib "
#~ "and other data science tools. Built a solid programming foundation for "
#~ "future AI learning."

#~ msgid "更早之前"
#~ msgstr "Earlier Days"

#~ msgid "对技术的原始好奇"
#~ msgstr "Original Curiosity for Technology"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对计算机科学的兴趣始于对\"机器如何思考\"这一问题的好奇。从第一行 Hello "
#~ "World 到如今能够训练神经网络模型，每一步都是对未知世界的探索。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "My interest in computer science began with wondering 'how machines "
#~ "think.' From the first Hello World to training neural networks, every "
#~ "step has been an exploration of the unknown."

#~ msgid "关于坚持"
#~ msgstr "On Persistence"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"学习 AI 不是一场短跑，而是一场没有终点的马拉松。重要的是每天都比昨天多理"
#~ "解一点点。\""
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\"Learning AI is not a sprint, but a marathon without a finish line. What "
#~ "matters is understanding a little more than yesterday.\""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "坚持做深度学习笔记整理这件事，已经成为了我日常生活的一部分。起初只是为了记"
#~ "录课程中的关键概念，但随着笔记越积越多，我发现这个过程本身比学习课程更有价"
#~ "值。写笔记不是简单的摘抄，而是强迫自己用最清晰的语言重新组织知识，在反复的"
#~ "推敲和修改中，很多曾经模糊的概念突然变得清晰起来。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Keeping deep learning notes has become part of my daily routine. "
#~ "Initially just for recording course concepts, I found the process itself "
#~ "more valuable than the courses. Note-taking isn't copying - it forces me "
#~ "to reorganize knowledge in the clearest language, and through repeated "
#~ "refinement, many fuzzy concepts suddenly become clear."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "在这个过程中，我深刻体会到：真正的学习不是\"听过\"或\"看过\"，而是能够用自"
#~ "己的语言重新表达，并且能够将不同领域的知识连接起来。深度学习的美妙之处在"
#~ "于，它不是一个孤立的学科——它连接着数学、统计学、计算机科学和认知科学，每一"
#~ "次学习都像是在拼图中加入新的一块。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Through this process, I deeply realized: real learning isn't 'hearing' or "
#~ "'seeing' - it's being able to re-express in your own words and connect "
#~ "knowledge across domains. Deep learning's beauty lies in connecting "
#~ "mathematics, statistics, computer science, and cognitive science - each "
#~ "piece of learning adds a new tile to the mosaic."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "最让我感到满足的时刻，不是完成某门课程，也不是跑通了某个模型，而是在某个深"
#~ "夜写笔记时，忽然发现自己在几个月前记下的疑问，如今已经有了自己的答案。这种"
#~ "\"过去和现在的自己对话\"的感觉，是自学路上最珍贵的体验。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The most satisfying moments aren't finishing courses or running models, "
#~ "but suddenly finding answers to questions I wrote months ago during late-"
#~ "night note sessions. This 'dialogue between past and present self' is the "
#~ "most precious experience on the self-learning journey."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "喜欢在 ArXiv 上浏览最新的 AI 论文，尤其关注 CV 和 NLP 领域的前沿进展。虽然"
#~ "很多论文读起来吃力，但每理解一个新 idea 都让人兴奋。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "I enjoy browsing the latest AI papers on ArXiv, especially CV and NLP "
#~ "advances. Though many papers are challenging, understanding each new idea "
#~ "is thrilling."

#~ msgid ""
